WEBVTT

00:11:29.916 --> 00:11:36.436
what you want is calmness, legibility,

00:11:36.436 --> 00:11:42.196
a sense of community, predictability.

00:11:42.196 --> 00:11:46.916
And we should never turn a city
into a theme park.

00:11:46.916 --> 00:11:48.076
In other words,

00:11:48.116 --> 00:11:50.996
despite the fact
that we must be very disciplined,

00:11:50.996 --> 00:11:54.196
and create calmness,
tranquility and so on,

00:11:54.196 --> 00:11:58.396
we still have to create a city
that is enjoyable to live in,

00:11:58.436 --> 00:11:59.636
so it's fun.

00:11:59.676 --> 00:12:03.716
Now once you know what creates
fun for the people,